{"title":"Wisconsin mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Wisconsin_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Wisconsin middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Wisconsin_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Wisconsin high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wisconsin_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Wisconsin middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Wisconsin middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_MathCounts\" title=\"Wisconsin MathCounts\">Wisconsin MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics,_Engineering_and_Science_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//talent.math.wisc.edu/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Wisconsin_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Wisconsin high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Wisconsin high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Central_Wisconsin_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Central Wisconsin Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Central Wisconsin Mathematics League</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//mathleague.uwsp.edu/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fox_Valley_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Fox Valley Math League (page does not exist)\">Fox Valley Math League</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.fvml.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics League (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics League</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_Mathematics,_Engineering_and_Science_Talent_Search&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin Mathematics, Engineering and Science Talent Search</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//talent.math.wisc.edu/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of ma